  )
  (weights-check :sum-declared 88 :note "The remaining headroom to 100 is the rhodium-only exemplary criteria (gate windows: formal-proofs, succession, provenance chains, spark-ready). A repo with no optional capabilities is scored purely on its applicable universal set.")
)
